/-! # Faithfully flat descent of coefficient modules

Appendix B.2 and Lemma B.4. Descent modules with the actual double-linear
overlap and triple cocycle are equivalent to modules over the base ring.
Finite generation, finite presentation, flatness, finite local freeness,
and constant rank descend along the same comparisons. They also identify
descended tensors, multilinear operations, chosen elements, and the
commutative squares of compatible maps.
